# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# Dictionary source files (downloaded by `make dict`)
.dict-src/

# 配布辞書はリポジトリに置かず、リリースに添付する (make dict で作るか make dict-download で取る)。
# dict/user/ などの入力の CSV は追跡するので、dict/ 全体は無視しない
/dict/*.hsd
/dict/*.hsd.zst
/dict/dictionaries.json
# hasami build / merge / repair の書き出しの一時ファイル (.<名前>.tmp-<pid>) と、
# hasami dict download の一時ファイル (.<ファイル名>.<乱数>.part)
/dict/.*.tmp-*
/dict/.*.part

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# Backup files (e.g. dictionary backups created by `hasami merge`)
*.bak
# `hasami repair` leaves the pre-repair dictionary next to the new one.
# It is a 700MB+ copy of a dictionary, so it must never be committed.
*.prev.hsd

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
